# The approximation state (3.18), which lands on the elements after it.
# Every technique and all three merging states, because each is a distinct
# arity in the writer and the round trip compares the values rather than
# only the technique.
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
vp 0
vp 1
cstype bspline
deg 1
ctech cparm 0.5
stech cparma 4 8
mg 1 0.25
curv 0 1 1 2
end
ctech cspace 2
stech cparmb 6
mg 0
curv2 1 2
end
ctech curv 0.5 30
stech cspace 1.5
mg 7
surf 0 1 0 1 1 2
end
stech curv 0.25 15
mg off
curv 0 1 1 2
end
f 1 1 1
